# Fixture for the measured --env-file trap: promptfoo loads --env-file AFTER the
# ambient environment, so this line OVERRIDES an already-exported
# PROMPTFOO_CONFIG_DIR and two concurrent CI jobs end up sharing one config dir
# and corrupting each other's SQLite. runner.py warns whenever --env-file is used
# and gate.yml refuses to run if eval/.env.ci contains this key.
PROMPTFOO_CONFIG_DIR=/tmp/hijacked
